# reactions_dash.tscn's reactions, as a rules sheet (CbRules: docs/looks.md, Rules sheets). Plain paths are
# from the scene's root.

# Dashed
on dash.started
    subject $at
    at point
    sound res://assets/sfx/prop_spawn.wav volume -10 pitch 1.6 jitter 0.1 range 30
    scene res://vfx/land.tscn life 2

# DoubleJumped
on dash.double_jump
    subject $at
    at point
    sound res://assets/sfx/jump.wav volume -12 pitch 1.4 range 25
    scene res://vfx/jump.tscn life 2
